{
  "id": "toys-r-us",
  "name": "Toys R Us",
  "category": "retailer_promotion",
  "description": {
    "text": "Toys \"R\" Us gave out promos in North America and Japan. Its Black & White booster two-packs, sold from 27 April 2011, each held one of Pansage BW14, Pidove BW15 or Axew BW16 hidden behind a card showing their silhouettes, alongside the store's Secret Egg promotion, in which players downloaded an Egg to Pokémon Black or White that hatched into one of the same three. From 2016 to 2018 its shops gave away holofoil cards with the Toys \"R\" Us logo on the picture: Generations cards in Canada in 2016, and later cards such as Piplup, given in North America on 3 February 2018 for the release of Ultra Prism.\n\nIn Japan, Toys\"R\"Us's Pokémon DE Bingo campaign (ポケモンDEビンゴ キャンペーン), from 22 November to 20 December 2007, gave Eevee 067/DP-P for one completed line and Cresselia 068/DP-P for two, both with new illustrations and attacks.",
